<tr><td>Bown &amp; Crowley (2007): trade deflection</td><td>Duties in one market push exports to another</td><td>Exporters face barriers elsewhere</td><td>US-tariff diversion toward the EU is plausible, not tested <span class="ref">[C14]</span></td></tr>
